  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "fire line shot; allies within range summon meteors with normal attacks",
    "skill1": "buff all allies ATK speed; grant energy on the first cast",
    "skill2": "AoE meteor rain reduces enemy Phys DEF",
    "skill3": "battle ATK speed increase",
    "skill4": "summon meteors to assist in battle",
    "skill5": "ultimate hit reduces target Phys DEF"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Lyca]] opens by **buffing all allies' attack speed** and fueling the first cast with bonus Energy for quick tempo. Her line shot lets nearby allies **summon meteors on normal attacks**, stacking area pressure alongside her ultimate volleys. AoE meteor rain also **shaves enemy Phys DEF**, and passive meteors assist throughout the fight while battle Haste keeps her rotation moving. Ultimate hits **deepen the DEF shred**, letting dealers exploit softened targets over time. She shines when **allies stay within ultimate range** and attack often enough to proc meteors on every cycle. Spread formations or **allies outside her line** waste her attack-speed package and meteor summons.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Lyca]] **buffs all allies' attack speed**, fuels the opener with **bonus Energy**, and layers **meteor pressure plus Phys DEF shred** so physical carries spike. The fight snowballs once meteors and shred are online \u2014 end her package early. **Delete [[Lyca]]** before the first blessing cycle with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]], or inhibit her buffed carry with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]]. **Race** your own carry with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]] so her tempo buff never decides the pace."
}
